          <div className="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 className="font-semibold text-slate-900">Resume Studio</h3><p className="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Create, organize, and submit resume versions for counselor feedback.</p></div><span className="rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-emerald-700">Student-controlled sharing</span></div>
